Maintainer: Project Aegis Maintainers <root@localhost>
Depends: python3, python3-pip, rsyslog, ufw, openssh-server, iproute2, whois, procps
Recommends: python3-venv, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, python3-numpy, python3-pandas, python3-psutil, python3-sklearn, python3-joblib
Description: Native Linux security monitoring daemon and desktop console
 Project Aegis monitors SSH authentication logs, collects host telemetry,
 detects brute-force and behavioral anomalies, enriches incidents, applies
 UFW mitigation decisions, and displays status in a PySide6 desktop dashboard.
